sequenceDiagram
    participant Repo as odh-gitops<br/>Repository
    participant GitOps as ArgoCD / Flux
    participant Cluster as Target Cluster
    participant OLM as OLM<br/>(OpenShift only)
    participant CertMgr as cert-manager
    participant Gateway as Inference Gateway<br/>(Istio Proxy)
    participant MaaSGW as MaaS Gateway<br/>(Istio Proxy)
    participant Authorino as Authorino
    participant KServe as KServe<br/>InferenceService
    participant MaaS as MaaS API Services
    participant Client as External Client

    Note over Repo,Cluster: Flow 1: GitOps Delivery
    Repo->>GitOps: Sync Application<br/>(Helm charts + Kustomize overlays)
    GitOps->>Cluster: kubectl apply -k / helm install
    Cluster-->>GitOps: Resources created

    Note over Cluster,OLM: Flow 2: Operator Lifecycle (OpenShift)
    Cluster->>OLM: OLM Subscriptions
    OLM->>OLM: InstallPlans created
    OLM->>Cluster: Operator Deployments
    Cluster->>Cluster: CR reconciliation<br/>(DataScienceCluster,<br/>DSCInitialization)

    Note over CertMgr,Gateway: Flow 3: Certificate Issuance
    Cluster->>CertMgr: Certificate CRs created
    CertMgr->>CertMgr: Issue TLS certs<br/>(rhai-ca-issuer)
    CertMgr->>Cluster: Store in Secrets
    Cluster->>Gateway: Referenced by Gateway<br/>TLS listeners
    Cluster->>MaaSGW: Referenced by Gateway<br/>TLS listeners
    Note over Cluster: CA trust distributed via<br/>rhai-ca-bundle ConfigMap

    Note over Client,KServe: Flow 4: Inference Traffic (xKS)
    Client->>Gateway: Request<br/>Port 80/443<br/>TLS termination
    Gateway->>KServe: HTTPRoute<br/>(Istio proxy sidecar<br/>with rhai-ca-bundle)
    KServe-->>Gateway: Inference Response
    Gateway-->>Client: Response

    Note over Client,MaaS: Flow 5: MaaS Traffic (xKS)
    Client->>MaaSGW: Request<br/>Port 80/443<br/>Istio proxy
    MaaSGW->>Authorino: Auth callback<br/>(SSL_CERT_FILE=<br/>/etc/pki/tls/custom/ca.crt)
    Authorino-->>MaaSGW: Auth result
    MaaSGW->>MaaS: Forward to<br/>MaaS API services
    MaaS-->>MaaSGW: Response
    MaaSGW-->>Client: Response
